.el .ds Aq '
.TH share 1  "share " 
.SH NAME
share \- Share a folder, printing a ticket (read\-only by default, \-\-write for write access)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshare\fR [\fB\-\-namespace\fR] [\fB\-\-blob\fR] [\fB\-\-write\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-pin\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-persist\fR] [\fB\-\-list\fR] [\fB\-\-rm\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fISELECTOR\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Share a folder, printing a ticket (read\-only by default, \-\-write for write access)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-namespace\fR \fI<NAMESPACE>\fR
Namespace ID or managed folder path
.TP
\fB\-\-blob\fR \fI<BLOB>\fR
Share a single content hash as an unauthenticated blob ticket (blobs are immutable; always pinned, never persisted)
.TP
\fB\-\-write\fR
Grant write access (default: read\-only)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-pin\fR
Skip pinning the shared folder\*(Aqs blobs
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-persist\fR
Skip persisting the share record
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
List persisted shares, optionally filtered by the positional selectors
.TP
\fB\-\-rm\fR
Stop sharing a folder or blob
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fISELECTOR\fR]
Folder path, namespace, or (with \-\-list) filters to list shares
